<IfModule mod_rewrite.c>
  RewriteEngine On
  RewriteBase /
  RewriteRule ^index\.html$ - [L]
  RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-f
  RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} !-d
  RewriteRule . /index.html [L]
</IfModule>
```
*(By putting this in the `public` folder, Vite will automatically copy it to the build folder during deployment.)*

### Step 5: Trigger the Deployment

1.  Save all your files.
2.  Commit and push the new workflow file to GitHub:
    ```bash
    git add .
    git commit -m "Add deployment workflow and htaccess"
    git push origin main